# Hand-off bundle for replicating the hero game elsewhere.
# The kit's source is the hero demo's source of truth — scripts/build-playables.mjs
# assembles public/playables/qq-knead-rush.html from it — so the code is tracked.
# Its sprite copies are not: they are byte-identical to public/assets/qq/, and the
# generated build points at those instead of shipping them twice.
replication-kit/assets/

